# hermes-taildrop.service: one run of hermes collect (retry the outbox, pick up the phones' Taildrops), started by
# hermes-taildrop.timer every 2 minutes and by "Collect now" on the Delivery page. Under 0.5 s when nothing waits.
[Unit]
Description=Hermes: collect Taildrops and retry the outbox

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=%h/.local/bin/hermes collect
Nice=10
